    <bpmn:task id="task_dosum4y9" name="Disk format writer" dai:notes="core/src/disk.rs: 4 KiB header sector (magic, version, metric, d&#39;, R, node_size, nodes_per_sector, sectors_per_node, count, medoid, MIPS M). Deviation from a literal reading of the design: small records are PACKED floor(4096/node_size) per sector (never straddling a sector, as in DiskANN) instead of each padded to 4 KiB — 5× less disk for 128-d; records &#62; 4 KiB span whole sectors (4096-d supported). LE; temp file + fsync + rename." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_4labcrp6">
