    <bpmn:task id="task_i12083zj" name="Catalog + manifest" dai:notes="core/src/store/mod.rs Catalog (BTreeMap under RwLock) over --data-dir; per-index manifest.json (config, main_gen, wal_start, built_at) written temp+rename+fsync = commit point. Main generation lives in main.&#60;gen&#62;/ (graph.bin, pq.bin, ids.bin, metadata.log, tombstones.bin) — a sub-directory instead of flat files so the swap is a single atomic manifest rename. Delete closes the index, waits for builder, removes dir (DELETED marker + cleanup at next start if Windows locks block it)." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_y9qudsi6">
