    <bpmn:task id="task_g4sndauc" name="WAL + recovery" dai:notes="core/src/wal.rs: wal.&#60;gen&#62;.log, CRC32-framed binary records, one write+fsync per batch before ack; replay stops at torn/corrupt record and truncates. Recovery replays every gen ≥ manifest.wal_start, removes stale main.* dirs and consumed WALs. Fixed during testing: WAL cleanup now only after a committed build (a failed build must not drop WALs)." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_jfq7pej8">
