    <bpmn:task id="task_6pqzfjhq" name="Persistence test (core)" dai:notes="Core: restart_persistence (upsert, delete, rebuild, delta upserts+deletes, crash without flush, reopen → identical results, deleted ids absent) and writes_during_build_are_kept pass. Process-level kill -9 test to follow with the server. Graceful shutdown (Catalog::shutdown) to be wired in the server.&#10;Process-level: crates/ex-index/tests/persistence.rs spawns the real binary, upserts 2000, deletes every 9th, rebuilds, upserts 300 more + deletes (delta &#38; main tombstones), SIGKILLs, restarts → same count, identical top-10 for 20 queries, deleted ids 404. Passes (covers &#39;Durability&#39; requirement)." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_6emj4264">
